+++ openssh-8.9p1/sshd_config.5
@@ -56,6 +56,19 @@ Arguments may optionally be enclosed in
 .Pq \&"
 in order to represent arguments containing spaces.
 .Pp
+Note that the default configuration file shipped with SUSE distributions
+begins by including the drop-in files
+.Pa /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/*.conf .
+Because these files are included at the start of the configuration file,
+options set there will override those in
+.Pa /etc/ssh/sshd_config .
+The files are processed in lexical order.
+To change the system-wide configuration, add a
+.Pa *.conf
+file to
+.Pa /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d
+instead of editing the configuration file itself.
+.Pp
